      "category": "BEHAVIORAL",
      "subject": "server",
      "stage": "rtsp_fsm",
      "description": "However, in cases where a server is not able to send a REDIRECT request to the agent, the server MAY need to resort to using 3rr responses to inform an agent with an established session about the need for redirecting the session.",
